{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "85655758c1380e6c15d79dc7b44e27aced78487bf33ae8c703fbf43ff8652510", "ja": "（近未来を舞台にした新作映画のリハーサルが終了。\nさて、ダスク役の千早は……あ、いたいた）", "zh": "（以近未来为舞台的新电影排练结束了。\n那么，饰演达斯克的千早……啊，在那儿呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "2b9e9be8450e03f20997fb82de417f23a2e216910460b45098f7e46753f4b5ab", "ja": "どうしよう……。\nやっぱり、相談してみたほうが……？", "zh": "怎么办才好……\n果然，还是去商量一下比较好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "65acd46e677fa9fff144dc790f21fbee5d91b09f12bf2d8a4e43b17fec8ce26a", "ja": "千早、リハーサルお疲れさま。\nどうした？　なにか心配事か？", "zh": "千早，彩排辛苦了。\n怎么了？是有什么烦心事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "44bfe1d311c664bc3053779200b944e8daee0017777d8de0e834a4500737c7b0", "ja": "っ……お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nはい。演技のことで、少しよろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "呃……辛苦了，{$P$}。\n嗯，关于演技，我可以请教您一些事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "405109ce7ab160b7885f63047ecb65750a5a908e6ba7ef983b1cac6ab393302e", "ja": "先ほどの私の演技ですが、{$P$}の\n目から見て、その……違和感はありませんでしたか？", "zh": "关于我刚才的演技，从{$P$}先生的角度来看，那个……没有觉得哪里不自然吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c0196a098f0905a203d5b6495e6a4f1ea8b2d55cd527320a749959e351c185a2", "ja": "え？　いや、ダスクの心情が伝わる\nいい演技だったと思うけど……。", "zh": "诶？没有啊，我觉得很好地传达出了达斯克的心情…… тәш", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "b9d8152ebbb5255c591acdd5eb3a698e7786142c7f68e99a2945dfb32e20476e", "ja": "そう、ですか。ありがとうございます……。\n…………。", "zh": "这样啊。谢谢你……\n\n…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1007_p", "source_sha256": "febe25e421f727965484df086e3e5217f57649c83c4ed370319f80dfa784ffe2", "ja": "すっきりしてないみたいだな。千早は\nいったいどこが、気になっているんだ？", "zh": "千寻好像还是没想通。  \n到底是哪里让你在意呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "7738cb99f09e199f71ecace6d9e72e7ac8e5e311d7e931d8939cb2a463390d48", "ja": "はい……細かいことは、台本には\n描かれていませんが……。", "zh": "是的……剧本里没有描写具体的细节……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "a9a6f2a4832275caf1b6e00d5a05e8611c3638a3ad6425d7a714515be0ebaa1d", "ja": "ダスクはバスターブレイドと出会うまで、\nひとりで旅をしてきたんですよね？", "zh": "达斯克在遇到破坏之刃之前，一直都是独自旅行的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1010_p", "source_sha256": "11a917cc9b9573962c835a12282f5e3dc3380aab7953aa1f7e7525abfcb6a841", "ja": "ああ、おそらくな。", "zh": "啊，我想应该是吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "105e213a99efcdaa972ff4a461eaef38fb06c4784c4a8c3ecacb716813bd5652", "ja": "離れ離れになった大切な人を救うため、\n危険に満ちた世界をひとりきりで歩く。", "zh": "为了拯救失散的珍爱之人，独自一人走过充满危险的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "894e6d357b6a0efcebb8e7c896793f7edb47afe29d7c31a784f0761f33966d4d", "ja": "それはきっと、仲間達に支えてもらっている\n今の私には、想像もつかないこと……。", "zh": "那一定是如今有伙伴们支持着我的我，根本无法想象的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "5e6546037f8fc73e35fc787f2883bca2e55bf0a713cb80b96b03002fbe7bb352", "ja": "そんな彼の、決して折れない凛とした強さを、\n私では表現しきれていないように思えて……。", "zh": "总觉得，我似乎没能充分表现出他那种绝不屈服的凛然坚强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "08f67a5f61e176b1a3a9e5fd62d79dacd20b6394186bb733f6d2a19af537da08", "ja": "なんだ、そんなことを心配していたのか。\nそんなことはないと思うよ。", "zh": "原来你是在担心这个啊。我觉得并不是那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "cbc9f9f69bc9bfda6abdea1b019c66a463c25b742f9b03270efb04ed387205dd", "ja": "えっ？　ですが……。", "zh": "诶？可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1016_p", "source_sha256": "39d0607a7150bf9e4f5f2f0260efaaeb1c41a53ebb271959dd51bd4dc295955f", "ja": "千早もこれまで色々悩んでくじけそうになっても、\nそのたびに立ち上がって、進み続けてきただろ。", "zh": "千早一直以来也经历过各种烦恼，差点撑不下去，但每一次都重新站起来，继续前进，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1017_p", "source_sha256": "21ba6b8978df9f952d478637ae459f169fe106b9784fc9917328156099d2db7a", "ja": "その事実は、間違いなく千早自身の強さだし、\n歌にも演技にも、それは表れてると思うよ。", "zh": "这一事实无疑正是千早自身的坚强，我觉得无论是歌声还是演技，都体现出了这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "5f310ac4d0c5e92bb80bd0d0d5fdd936c90dfa26e63f49d93b808bb3423cf8d2", "ja": "私なりの強さ……。そう……そうですね。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "属于我的坚强……是吗……是啊。\n{$P$}先生，谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "65e3dde46dfacfcf35d7b614f926c12c6d111e958dbec0eb26ce3b43a0d774ce", "ja": "彼と私は、生きる世界は違っても、積み上げていく\n想いは同じ……いえ、負けられませんね。ふふっ。", "zh": "我和他即便身处的世界不同，但不断积攒的\n心意却是一样的……不对，我可不能输给他呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0153_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6f53a12f1e04ffadf6bdc3f3b1c00b006136e9373766b5f89e5da95f8886f131", "ja": "（そう言って笑う千早の笑顔は、まるで本物のダスクの\nようで……。明日の撮影も成功間違いなしだな！）", "zh": "千早笑着说话时的笑容，简直就像真正的达斯克一样……明天的拍摄肯定也会成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
